<title>UK: Mellor to be Anglian MD in Smith's absence.</title>
<headline>Mellor to be Anglian MD in Smith's absence.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>British regional utility Anglian Water Plc said on Thursday that its group finance director Chris Mellor would be the acting group managing director from June 21, 1997.</p>
<p>Mellor would be in that position till Alan Smith, who will shortly undergo an operation to cure an ear problem, returns to his duties.</p>
<p>Smith is expected to return to work in late August.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4366</p>
